KIMI</div><span class="pill">quick recall</span></div>
      <div class="test-head"><div class="brand" style="font-size:10px;color:#8e90a0">AFTER THE SESSION</div><h1>Who do you remember?</h1><p>Select every face you remember seeing. Don’t overthink it.</p></div>
      <div class="memory-grid" id="memoryGrid1"></div>
      <div class="test-actions"><button class="cta" onclick="saveMemoryStep1()">Continue</button></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Memory test 2 -->
    <section class="screen test-screen" id="memory2">
      <div class="status"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div><div class="topbar"><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="pill">interest recall</span></div>
      <div class="test-head"><h1>Who would you want to see again?</h1><p>Select the people you’d genuinely be curious to reopen.</p></div>
      <div class="memory-grid" id="memoryGrid2"></div>
      <div class="test-actions"><button class="cta secondary" onclick="show('memory1')">Back</button><button class="cta" onclick="saveMemoryStep2()">Continue</button></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Memory test 3 -->
    <section class="screen test-screen" id="memory3">
      <div class="status"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div><div class="topbar"><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="pill">final questions</span></div>
      <div class="test-head"><h1>One last minute.</h1><p>We care more about what you actually remember and want to do than whether you “liked the idea.”</p></div>
      <div class="test-card"><label>What do you remember about any of the people?</label><textarea id="memoryText" placeholder="A line, a detail, a feeling, anything that stuck…"></textarea></div>
      <div class="test-card"><label>Which way would you want to show interest tomorrow?</label><div class="choice-row" id="gestureChoice"><button class="choice-chip" data-v="gesture" onclick="pickChoice('gestureChoice',this)">Connect gesture</button><button class="choice-chip" data-v="button" onclick="pickChoice('gestureChoice',this)">Button</button><button class="choice-chip" data-v="swipe" onclick="pickChoice('gestureChoice',this)">Swipe</button></div></div>
      <div class="test-card"><label>Would you come back tomorrow for five new people?</label><div class="choice-row" id="returnChoice"><button class="choice-chip" data-v="yes" onclick="pickChoice('returnChoice',this)">Yes</button><button class="choice-chip" data-v="maybe" onclick="pickChoice('returnChoice',this)">Maybe</button><button class="choice-chip" data-v="no" onclick="pickChoice('returnChoice',this)">No</button></div></div>
      <div class="test-card"><label>Finish this, if you want</label><textarea id="ownPrompt" maxlength="220" placeholder="In my head, I’m…"></textarea></div>
      <div class="test-actions"><button class="cta secondary" onclick="show('memory2')">Back</button><button class="cta" onclick="finishResearch()">Finish test</button></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Completion -->
    <section class="screen test-screen" id="results">
      <div class="status"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div><div class="topbar"><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span class="pill">complete</span></div>
      <div class="test-head"><div class="brand" style="font-size:10px;color:#8e90a0">THANK YOU</div><h1>That’s it.</h1><p>Your choices have been saved on this device. We intentionally don’t show scores or comparisons here — that would bias future tests.</p></div>
      <div class="result-note"><b>For the researcher:</b><br>Download the session file below. It contains anonymous test metadata, profile order, dwell time, connect/pass actions, recall selections and final answers.</div>
      <div class="test-card"><label>Session ID</label><div id="completionId" style="font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#626575;word-break:break-all"></div></div>
      <div class="test-actions"><button class="cta secondary" id="fallbackDownload" style="display:none" onclick="exportResearch()">Download backup file</button></div>
      <div class="test-actions" style="padding-top:0"><button class="cta secondary" onclick="resetResearch()">New test session</button></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Match modal -->
    <div class="modal" id="matchModal"><div class="match-card"><div class="match-lines"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 118"><defs><linearGradient id="mg1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#ff7898"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ae8dff"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="mg2" x1="1" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#73d8c7"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#8f82ff"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M-5 72 C57 26 89 87 127 62 C142 52 149 47 157 50" stroke="url(#mg1)"/><path d="M305 34 C248 84 217 29 178 57 C168 65 160 68 151 65" stroke="url(#mg2)"/><path class="cross" d="M148 63 C155 57 161 54 168 55" stroke="#b08fff"/></svg></div><div class="brand" style="margin-bottom:14px">MINUKIMI</div><h2>You found each other.</h2><p id="matchText">Maya connected with you too.</p><div class="match-actions"><button class="cta" onclick="closeMatch();openChat('Maya')">Say hello</button><button class="cta secondary" onclick="closeMatch()">Keep looking</button></div></div></div>

    <!-- Stop modal -->
    <div class="modal" id="stopModal"><div class="stop-card"><span class="k">KIMI · quick exit</span><h3>End this connection?</h3><p>KIMI is never sent as a message. It simply opens this exit. You can also use End, Block or Report from the menu at any time.</p><div class="stop-grid"><button class="cta danger" onclick="endChat(false)">End chat</button><button class="cta report" onclick="endChat(true)">End & report</button><button class="cta secondary" onclick="hideStop()">Cancel</button></div></div></div>
  </main>
</div>
